    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>把这段时间学的东西记下来，以后忘了直接翻自己博客查。</p><hr><h2 id="一、Markdown-语法"><a href="#一、Markdown-语法" class="headerlink" title="一、Markdown 语法"></a>一、Markdown 语法</h2><h3 id="1-标题"><a href="#1-标题" class="headerlink" title="1. 标题"></a>1. 标题</h3><p>几个 <code>#</code> 就是几级标题，<code>#</code> 后面必须空一格。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="section">## 二级标题（章节用这个最多）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">### 三级标题（小节用）</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-文字格式"><a href="#2-文字格式" class="headerlink" title="2. 文字格式"></a>2. 文字格式</h3><p>平时写字用的最多的几个：</p><ul><li><strong>加粗</strong>：<code>**文字**</code> → <strong>文字</strong></li><li><em>斜体</em>：<code>*文字*</code> → <em>文字</em></li><li><del>删除线</del>：<code>~~文字~~</code> → <del>文字</del></li><li><code>行内代码</code>：<code>`文字`</code> → 写函数名、变量名的时候用</li></ul><h3 id="3-列表"><a href="#3-列表" class="headerlink" title="3. 列表"></a>3. 列表</h3><p><strong>无序列表</strong>（用 <code>-</code>）：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> 第一项</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> 第二项</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 缩进的子项</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>有序列表</strong>（直接写数字）：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="bullet">1.</span> 第一步</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">2.</span> 第二步</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-其他常用"><a href="#4-其他常用" class="headerlink" title="4. 其他常用"></a>4. 其他常用</h3><p><strong>引用</strong>：写笔记、引用别人的话的时候用</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; 这是引用的内容</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>链接</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">[<span class="string">显示的文字</span>](<span class="link">https://www.baidu.com</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>图片</strong>：把图片放到 <code>source/images/</code> 文件夹里</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">![<span class="string">图片描述</span>](<span class="link">/images/photo.jpg</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>分割线</strong>：三个减号</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">---</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="5-代码块（写-C-语言必用）"><a href="#5-代码块（写-C-语言必用）" class="headerlink" title="5. 代码块（写 C 语言必用）"></a>5. 代码块（写 C 语言必用）</h3><p>三对反引号包起来，还能自动语法高亮：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="code">```c</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">int main() &#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">    printf(&quot;Hello World\n&quot;);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">    return 0;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">```</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="二、Hexo-命令"><a href="#二、Hexo-命令" class="headerlink" title="二、Hexo 命令"></a>二、Hexo 命令</h2><p>所有命令都要在<strong>博客根目录</strong>下跑（就是有 <code>_config.yml</code> 的那个文件夹）。</p><h3 id="1-写文章三步"><a href="#1-写文章三步" class="headerlink" title="1. 写文章三步"></a>1. 写文章三步</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 第一步：新建文章（标题用英文引号！）</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo new post <span class="string">&quot;文章标题&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 第二步：本地预览（浏览器打开 http://localhost:4000 看效果）</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo s</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 第三步：发布上线</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo clean   <span class="comment"># 清掉旧缓存</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo g       <span class="comment"># 生成网页</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo d       <span class="comment"># 上传到 GitHub</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>看完预览按 <code>Ctrl + C</code> 关掉本地服务器。</p></blockquote><h3 id="2-其他常用命令"><a href="#2-其他常用命令" class="headerlink" title="2. 其他常用命令"></a>2. 其他常用命令</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 用记事本打开文件</span></span><br><span class="line">notepad 文件名.md</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 回到上级目录</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> ..</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 看当前目录下有什么文件</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">ls</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="三、踩过的坑"><a href="#三、踩过的坑" class="headerlink" title="三、踩过的坑"></a>三、踩过的坑</h2><h3 id="1-YAML-冒号后面必须空一格"><a href="#1-YAML-冒号后面必须空一格" class="headerlink" title="1. YAML 冒号后面必须空一格"></a>1. YAML 冒号后面必须空一格</h3><p>✅ 正确：<code>tags: 随笔</code><br>❌ 错误：<code>tags:随笔</code></p><p>不然整个配置文件直接崩，报一堆莫名其妙的错。</p><h3 id="2-命令行里要用英文引号"><a href="#2-命令行里要用英文引号" class="headerlink" title="2. 命令行里要用英文引号"></a>2. 命令行里要用英文引号</h3><p>中文引号会导致终端卡住，按回车只换行不执行命令。<br>遇到这种情况按 <code>Ctrl + C</code> 取消，重新输入就行。</p><h3 id="3-hexo-命令不能在-themes-文件夹里跑"><a href="#3-hexo-命令不能在-themes-文件夹里跑" class="headerlink" title="3. hexo 命令不能在 themes 文件夹里跑"></a>3. hexo 命令不能在 themes 文件夹里跑</h3><p>进到主题文件夹里跑 hexo 会报一堆 Usage 帮助信息。<br><code>cd ../..</code> 退回到博客根目录就好了。</p><h3 id="4-改完配置一定要跑-hexo-clean"><a href="#4-改完配置一定要跑-hexo-clean" class="headerlink" title="4. 改完配置一定要跑 hexo clean"></a>4. 改完配置一定要跑 hexo clean</h3><p>不然旧缓存会留在本地，改了东西看不到效果。</p>]]>
    </content>
